--- !u!114 &779392762
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 779392761}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  failBranch: 
  dialog:
  - text: Welcome to my lair!
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: Do you really have to light all the candles every time?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1891132014}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: "It\u2019s important to get in the right headspace. Especially for your
      first time. "
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I heard that when Jade did her first soul release, she was so overwhelmed
      with power that she entered a blind fury\u2026 She smashed all our clay pots,
      tore up our scrolls and then passed out for three days straight \r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: "\u2026Obviously thats not gonna happen to you, being a.. strong brave
      Spartan and all"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: "\u2026Jade?\r\n"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "Never mind, I\u2019m just messing with you"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: " \u2026Soul\u2026 release?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "You, my friend, are the proud owner of a Soulblade. You\u2019re it\u2019s
      true owner- it\u2019s master. "
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1891132014}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "And that means you\u2019re special - only you can perform it\u2019s most
      powerful technique.\r\n"
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Happy
  - text: When you perform the SOUL RELEASE, your blood melds with the blood of everyone
      who has wielded the blade. Their power mixes with yours
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Every family has honed their own special technique over the years. And
      something about this place -this town- seems to amplify it further. Whaddaya
      say, Jack. Is it time we find out yours?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1891132014}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "(You start to think you\u2019re a fraud - after all your mom made this
      sword herself.. But Big Sam did say it had a soul)\r\n"
    name: 
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "I dunno about this.. But hey, it\u2019s worth a try, right? How bad can
      it be"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Stretch, ladies first
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 1891132014}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: Ugh, I hate this part. But we do what must be done
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: IdleStretch
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (Stretch takes a nervous breath, and holds the sword up to her palm)
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: Unsheath
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Happy
  - text: 'SOUL RELEASE: ENERGIZING RUSH'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 779392763}
    pose: Cut
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Mad
  - text: What.. is happening?
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Surprised
  turnToFace: 1
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
